<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">As of June&nbsp;30, 2026, the Company had cash
and cash equivalents and short-term investment of RMB31.4 million (US$4.6 million), compared with RMB134.7 million
as of December&nbsp;31, 2025.</P>

